1
00:00:22,961 --> 00:00:24,170
Soo-hyun!

2
00:00:25,630 --> 00:00:26,798
You bastard!

3
00:00:26,881 --> 00:00:28,424
Hey! Shit!

4
00:00:29,926 --> 00:00:32,512
Hey, man! Soo-hyun!

5
00:00:32,595 --> 00:00:34,180
Hey! I just wanna talk!

6
00:00:35,932 --> 00:00:37,475
Soo-hyun!

7
00:00:37,559 --> 00:00:39,227
Just talk to me for a second!

8
00:00:39,310 --> 00:00:40,979
Hey!

9
00:00:41,062 --> 00:00:42,981
-Soo-hyun!
-Huh?

10
00:00:43,064 --> 00:00:45,024
-Soo-hyun, talk to me! Stop!
-What the hell?

11
00:00:45,108 --> 00:00:46,985
Soo-hyun. You punk!

12
00:00:47,527 --> 00:00:48,361
Soo-hyun!

13
00:00:48,444 --> 00:00:49,571
Hey!

14
00:00:49,654 --> 00:00:50,905
I said let's talk, man.

15
00:00:51,489 --> 00:00:52,866
Where are you going? Hey!

16
00:00:52,949 --> 00:00:54,868
What's wrong with you? Let's just talk!

17
00:00:54,951 --> 00:00:55,785
Open up for a sec.

18
00:00:56,369 --> 00:00:57,829
Hey!

19
00:00:57,912 --> 00:01:00,206
Just talk to me, you bastard!

20
00:01:00,290 --> 00:01:02,959
Look at me. Soo-hyun! Goddamn it!

21
00:01:03,042 --> 00:01:04,961
Hey! Stop the car!

22
00:01:06,546 --> 00:01:08,339
Wait. Just a second.

23
00:01:08,423 --> 00:01:09,507
Just a sec, Soo-hyun!

24
00:01:09,591 --> 00:01:10,508
Just talk to me.

25
00:01:10,592 --> 00:01:12,427
Wait! Hey!

26
00:01:12,510 --> 00:01:14,179
Hey! Don't go, man!

27
00:01:18,600 --> 00:01:19,475
Get in, you idiot!

28
00:01:19,559 --> 00:01:22,437
What the hell are you doing
yelling "Soo-hyun" over there?

29
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:23,438
Shit!

30
00:01:41,289 --> 00:01:42,415
Damn it.

31
00:02:29,170 --> 00:02:32,298
MOUSETRAP

32
00:02:57,073 --> 00:02:58,283
That little…

33
00:03:32,984 --> 00:03:33,818
JE MOON-JAE

34
00:03:34,861 --> 00:03:35,695
Hey, Moon-jae.

35
00:03:36,321 --> 00:03:38,489
It was a trap. A damn trap!

36
00:03:38,573 --> 00:03:39,532
They're on my tail!

37
00:03:45,538 --> 00:03:47,957
You said you'd let us live
if I did what you said!

38
00:03:48,041 --> 00:03:49,625
-You gonna do what I say?
-What?

39
00:03:52,628 --> 00:03:54,881
I can't hear you!

40
00:03:55,381 --> 00:03:56,966
You're supposed to do what I say.

41
00:04:13,983 --> 00:04:15,818
What the hell are they doing?

42
00:04:15,902 --> 00:04:17,445
And who the hell are they chasing?

43
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:33,336
What if only one of you can live?

44
00:04:34,754 --> 00:04:35,588
Soo-hyun.

45
00:04:36,923 --> 00:04:39,008
I don't think both of you can live.

46
00:04:40,468 --> 00:04:41,302
Hello?

47
00:04:45,515 --> 00:04:46,933
One of you should live.

48
00:04:47,767 --> 00:04:48,851
Don't you think?

49
00:04:54,649 --> 00:04:56,359
-What's the matter, sir?
-Hey, kid.

50
00:04:56,442 --> 00:04:58,444
I'm chasing someone.

51
00:04:58,528 --> 00:04:59,987
I might need your help--

52
00:05:04,951 --> 00:05:05,868
Hello?

53
00:05:06,619 --> 00:05:07,620
Sir?

54
00:05:08,579 --> 00:05:09,580
Hello?

55
00:05:12,667 --> 00:05:13,543
Sir!

56
00:05:18,214 --> 00:05:19,298
Soo-hyun!

57
00:05:20,758 --> 00:05:22,802
Soo-hyun! Just pull over!

58
00:05:24,178 --> 00:05:25,138
Hey, bastard!

59
00:05:25,221 --> 00:05:26,973
Soo-hyun! Pull over! Hey!

60
00:05:27,056 --> 00:05:28,641
Soo-hyun! Let's just talk! Hey!

61
00:05:28,724 --> 00:05:29,892
Soo-hyun!

62
00:05:38,359 --> 00:05:39,819
We have to stop him! He'll die.

63
00:05:39,902 --> 00:05:42,029
-Huh?
-He's gonna kill himself!

64
00:06:07,346 --> 00:06:08,556
Hey, Soo-hyun.

65
00:06:08,639 --> 00:06:09,599
Soo-hyun!

66
00:06:12,059 --> 00:06:12,894
What?

67
00:06:16,522 --> 00:06:17,899
Noja.

68
00:06:19,775 --> 00:06:21,068
Hey, that bastard…

69
00:06:23,696 --> 00:06:24,614
Soo-hyun.

70
00:06:25,198 --> 00:06:26,073
Hey, Soo-hyun!

71
00:06:26,157 --> 00:06:27,283
-Get down, punk!
-Hey!

72
00:06:27,366 --> 00:06:28,993
-Hey, get down!
-Get down!

73
00:06:29,076 --> 00:06:29,911
Get down.

74
00:06:31,537 --> 00:06:32,705
Get down. What are you…

75
00:06:32,788 --> 00:06:34,582
Get a hold of yourself!

76
00:06:42,423 --> 00:06:44,175
He called himself "The Rat."

77
00:06:45,384 --> 00:06:46,886
He said he knows you well.

78
00:06:46,969 --> 00:06:47,929
Okay. Just get down.

79
00:06:48,012 --> 00:06:50,264
Who's the Rat? Who's that bastard?

80
00:06:51,891 --> 00:06:52,767
He's Moon-jae.

81
00:06:52,850 --> 00:06:54,268
For fuck's sake.

82
00:06:54,352 --> 00:06:55,186
Je Moon-jae.

83
00:06:56,103 --> 00:06:57,730
Hey, I'm Je Moon-jae--

84
00:06:57,813 --> 00:07:01,609
Fuck, I don't even know
who the real Moon-jae is anymore.

85
00:07:02,318 --> 00:07:05,154
-Hey, it's been a long time.
-Been a while, Soo-hyun.

86
00:07:05,238 --> 00:07:06,280
See you inside.

87
00:07:09,575 --> 00:07:12,912
It was around this time last year
when I first met him.

88
00:07:12,995 --> 00:07:14,830
Shit, what's that bastard doing here?

89
00:07:14,914 --> 00:07:17,208
Hey, what are you doing here?

90
00:07:17,291 --> 00:07:18,376
Hey, Soo-hyun.

91
00:07:18,459 --> 00:07:19,377
You're here.

92
00:07:19,460 --> 00:07:21,003
He even knew my name.

93
00:07:21,087 --> 00:07:23,297
He knew everything about us.

94
00:07:25,049 --> 00:07:27,218
I need some money.

95
00:07:27,927 --> 00:07:30,346
The money you guys stole.

96
00:07:30,846 --> 00:07:32,848
He even threatened
to report us to the police

97
00:07:33,933 --> 00:07:36,352
for skimming the investment funds.

98
00:07:36,435 --> 00:07:39,146
I have a family.
I had no choice but to do what he said.

99
00:07:40,606 --> 00:07:42,275
After all,

100
00:07:42,775 --> 00:07:44,235
we're both frauds.

101
00:07:46,946 --> 00:07:47,780
Yeah.

102
00:07:47,863 --> 00:07:49,782
You're right. Just get down.

103
00:07:49,865 --> 00:07:51,367
Get down. Then we'll talk.

104
00:07:51,450 --> 00:07:52,326
Who is he?

105
00:07:52,410 --> 00:07:54,662
Just tell me who he is. Okay?

106
00:07:57,832 --> 00:08:00,668
Then he suddenly told me
to bring your phone.

107
00:08:15,808 --> 00:08:17,977
He said he'd been preparing
for a long time.

108
00:08:18,644 --> 00:08:21,314
He even changed his face and voice

109
00:08:22,023 --> 00:08:24,108
to take everything you've got.

110
00:08:25,067 --> 00:08:26,193
Didn't I tell you?

111
00:08:26,277 --> 00:08:27,945
Everything was planned.

112
00:08:28,029 --> 00:08:31,282
The phone, the broken glass…

113
00:08:31,365 --> 00:08:33,075
Maybe even Da-eun's kidnapping.

114
00:08:33,826 --> 00:08:36,621
When I hesitated to pay him,
he kidnapped Da-eun.

115
00:08:36,704 --> 00:08:38,456
He said he'd kill her if I got caught.

116
00:08:38,539 --> 00:08:40,041
Exactly. Come on.

117
00:08:40,124 --> 00:08:42,710
Just think of Da-eun, okay?

118
00:08:42,793 --> 00:08:43,878
Come down.

119
00:08:43,961 --> 00:08:45,796
-Shit.
-Goddamn it!

120
00:08:45,880 --> 00:08:48,924
I just had to hold out a little longer.

121
00:08:49,008 --> 00:08:52,553
He said he'd let Da-eun go soon.

122
00:08:53,554 --> 00:08:55,890
Fuck. Then it would've been all over.

123
00:08:55,973 --> 00:08:56,932
You're right.

124
00:08:57,016 --> 00:08:58,934
Hey, it's all over.

125
00:08:59,018 --> 00:09:01,020
Get a hold of yourself! You…

126
00:09:01,103 --> 00:09:03,564
Soo-hyun.
Let's catch that bastard together. Okay?

127
00:09:03,648 --> 00:09:05,733
We can catch that bastard together.

128
00:09:05,816 --> 00:09:07,151
It's all over. Fuck.

129
00:09:07,234 --> 00:09:09,695
The moment I don't do as I'm told,

130
00:09:10,655 --> 00:09:11,739
Da-eun dies.

131
00:09:12,990 --> 00:09:15,868
You have no idea
how scary that bastard is.

132
00:09:15,951 --> 00:09:18,287
So who the hell is that bastard?

133
00:09:18,371 --> 00:09:19,622
Who is he? Just tell me.

134
00:09:19,705 --> 00:09:21,874
There's gotta be a reason he's doing this!

135
00:09:22,667 --> 00:09:24,752
Yes. That's it.

136
00:09:26,337 --> 00:09:28,089
He said you'd know why.

137
00:09:29,423 --> 00:09:30,299
Me?

138
00:09:30,800 --> 00:09:32,885
You said the broken window
was a bug, right?

139
00:09:33,886 --> 00:09:35,221
Yeah, it was a bug.

140
00:09:35,304 --> 00:09:37,473
Because that bastard's a bug in our lives.

141
00:09:40,226 --> 00:09:41,519
This is all…

142
00:09:44,271 --> 00:09:45,481
because of your lies.

143
00:09:49,985 --> 00:09:51,320
We're screwed, you bastard.

144
00:09:54,448 --> 00:09:55,533
What lies…

145
00:09:56,659 --> 00:09:57,868
-Huh?
-Grab him!

146
00:09:57,952 --> 00:09:58,953
Grab him!

147
00:10:08,003 --> 00:10:09,213
Fuck!

148
00:10:09,296 --> 00:10:10,589
Hey!

149
00:10:13,426 --> 00:10:14,969
Fuck!

150
00:10:29,108 --> 00:10:29,942
Turn around.

151
00:10:36,031 --> 00:10:37,158
Fuck!

152
00:10:42,163 --> 00:10:45,374
"Lies"? What the hell did he mean,
you punk?

153
00:10:47,626 --> 00:10:48,461
What?

154
00:10:52,047 --> 00:10:54,633
Let's say you're the captain
of a passenger plane.

155
00:10:55,634 --> 00:10:58,053
You're flying a plane full of passengers,

156
00:10:58,554 --> 00:11:00,765
when you realize there's a malfunction.

157
00:11:02,224 --> 00:11:03,642
A critical malfunction.

158
00:11:06,228 --> 00:11:07,980
Beyond repair.

159
00:11:08,063 --> 00:11:09,690
Then what would you do?

160
00:11:10,191 --> 00:11:13,152
Would you tell the passengers
the plane's going to crash?

161
00:11:13,235 --> 00:11:16,447
Or would you keep it a secret

162
00:11:17,281 --> 00:11:19,074
and just let it crash?

163
00:11:19,867 --> 00:11:21,076
Is something wrong?

164
00:11:23,412 --> 00:11:26,332
When we met again after graduating,

165
00:11:26,415 --> 00:11:29,293
you'd changed so much,
I didn't even recognize you.

166
00:11:34,215 --> 00:11:37,426
Never mind. Heavy rain tomorrow.
Don't forget your umbrella.

167
00:11:38,511 --> 00:11:39,386
Right.

168
00:11:41,263 --> 00:11:43,182
You wouldn't need an umbrella.

169
00:11:51,524 --> 00:11:54,443
He could've given us his phone
before he died.

170
00:11:55,152 --> 00:11:57,404
So it'd at least be easier
to find the bastard.

171
00:12:01,909 --> 00:12:04,453
-Let's go to the police station, Noja.
-To do what?

172
00:12:04,537 --> 00:12:06,705
Report him? Or turn yourself in?

173
00:12:06,789 --> 00:12:08,541
Either way.

174
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:11,293
A man just died.

175
00:12:11,377 --> 00:12:13,379
And his kid was kidnapped.

176
00:12:13,879 --> 00:12:15,130
We can't handle this.

177
00:12:15,798 --> 00:12:16,924
What about the money?

178
00:12:19,134 --> 00:12:19,969
Noja.

179
00:12:20,469 --> 00:12:22,638
A man just died in front of us.

180
00:12:23,138 --> 00:12:24,807
Does money even matter right now?

181
00:12:27,268 --> 00:12:30,771
A man just died over money.
So money matters more than people.

182
00:12:36,235 --> 00:12:37,069
You bastard.

183
00:12:37,820 --> 00:12:39,280
Don't do that.

184
00:12:40,906 --> 00:12:42,658
I don't even have full coverage.

185
00:12:43,367 --> 00:12:45,369
Even the police won't believe you.

186
00:12:45,870 --> 00:12:47,037
How will you prove it?

187
00:12:47,538 --> 00:12:50,457
You're not Je Moon-jae anymore.
And I'm just a thug.

188
00:12:51,667 --> 00:12:54,044
We'll have to handle this.

189
00:12:55,546 --> 00:12:58,424
Because that rat bastard
is our only proof.

190
00:13:26,160 --> 00:13:27,411
What are you doing here?

191
00:13:28,370 --> 00:13:29,830
Smoking.

192
00:13:32,333 --> 00:13:35,210
You could've called a tow truck.
Why me? I worked all night.

193
00:13:35,794 --> 00:13:37,630
Because I missed you, you bastard.

194
00:13:39,340 --> 00:13:40,174
Why are you here?

195
00:13:40,257 --> 00:13:43,135
I don't even know what kind of shit
I've gotten myself into.

196
00:13:43,218 --> 00:13:44,053
Hey.

197
00:13:48,557 --> 00:13:49,683
Are you okay?

198
00:13:51,602 --> 00:13:53,896
DONGBU POLICE STATION

199
00:14:01,695 --> 00:14:02,696
So what is it?

200
00:14:02,780 --> 00:14:05,240
You've got nothing? Huh?

201
00:14:05,324 --> 00:14:08,535
You don't know where they went,
and you wrecked your car for nothing.

202
00:14:09,662 --> 00:14:12,539
So what's this case about?

203
00:14:12,623 --> 00:14:15,084
I don't know. I'll have to find out.

204
00:14:15,167 --> 00:14:16,710
Take the toothbrush out.

205
00:14:16,794 --> 00:14:19,004
You were probably goofing off, you punk.

206
00:14:20,255 --> 00:14:21,799
I said I'll have to find out.

207
00:14:21,882 --> 00:14:24,176
You told me to follow up on the tip,
so I did.

208
00:14:24,259 --> 00:14:26,178
And I ended up wrecking my car!

209
00:14:26,261 --> 00:14:28,263
Are you gonna reimburse me for it?

210
00:14:28,347 --> 00:14:30,224
-You fucking won't!
-You bastard!

211
00:14:30,307 --> 00:14:32,184
I almost fucking died doing my job!

212
00:14:32,267 --> 00:14:35,062
Give me shit again,
and I'm fucking quitting.

213
00:14:35,145 --> 00:14:36,605
-Yeah, go ahead!
-Move!

214
00:14:36,689 --> 00:14:37,564
Quit, you bastard.

215
00:14:37,648 --> 00:14:39,441
Sun-yong! Just quit already.

216
00:14:39,525 --> 00:14:41,026
Where do you think you're going?

217
00:14:41,110 --> 00:14:43,445
-Sir, calm down.
-He's so fucking rude.

218
00:14:43,529 --> 00:14:46,365
He might be tangled up
in more than one complicated case.

219
00:14:47,616 --> 00:14:48,575
That's what he said.

220
00:14:51,996 --> 00:14:54,164
Learn from him, okay?

221
00:14:54,665 --> 00:14:56,500
He's not one to bark up the wrong tree.

222
00:15:27,906 --> 00:15:29,074
"So Min-yeong."

223
00:15:30,701 --> 00:15:32,578
Do these belong to the one in the morgue?

224
00:15:33,954 --> 00:15:34,788
Yes.

225
00:15:44,131 --> 00:15:45,716
Move the operation now.

226
00:15:45,799 --> 00:15:48,093
We need more identities.
Check Seoul Station again.

227
00:15:49,470 --> 00:15:50,471
Yes, sir.

228
00:15:52,431 --> 00:15:53,432
Watch Noja.

229
00:15:54,016 --> 00:15:54,892
-Yes, sir.
-Got it.

230
00:15:56,143 --> 00:15:57,061
Get home safe.

231
00:16:07,654 --> 00:16:10,949
The police came to the daycare
because of the kidnapping.

232
00:16:11,450 --> 00:16:13,035
They didn't come for us.

233
00:16:13,118 --> 00:16:14,870
Our police are good at what they do.

234
00:16:14,953 --> 00:16:18,582
They'll find your friend's daughter,
even if we don't.

235
00:16:19,166 --> 00:16:22,294
You try to figure out who the Rat is.

236
00:16:22,377 --> 00:16:23,420
Okay?

237
00:16:23,504 --> 00:16:25,839
Before your friend jumped off,

238
00:16:26,340 --> 00:16:29,927
he said you'd know
why the Rat bastard is doing…

239
00:16:49,238 --> 00:16:51,115
I definitely locked the door
before I left.

240
00:16:54,493 --> 00:16:55,369
Noja.

241
00:17:00,249 --> 00:17:01,083
What is that?

242
00:17:01,750 --> 00:17:03,168
418-3 HWASAN-RI, GANGSANG-MYEON

243
00:17:22,521 --> 00:17:24,439
This is the right address.

244
00:17:27,901 --> 00:17:29,987
What on earth could be here?

245
00:17:30,070 --> 00:17:31,196
Let's see what's here.

246
00:18:35,177 --> 00:18:37,012
SON DA-EUN

247
00:19:31,775 --> 00:19:34,820
Sir. The team leader's looking for you.

248
00:19:37,739 --> 00:19:38,615
What now?

249
00:19:38,699 --> 00:19:40,284
Backup for another precinct.

250
00:19:40,367 --> 00:19:41,201
It's a Code Zero.

251
00:19:48,458 --> 00:19:50,877
Abducted a week ago.
Reported yesterday by her mom.

252
00:19:50,961 --> 00:19:52,879
-And--
-A week ago?

253
00:19:52,963 --> 00:19:54,548
She should've reported it sooner.

254
00:19:54,631 --> 00:19:56,300
-Why did she wait?
-I don't know!

255
00:19:57,259 --> 00:20:00,053
The thing is, the dad's missing too.

256
00:20:00,137 --> 00:20:01,972
Guess we should go get briefed.

257
00:20:03,056 --> 00:20:06,059
Oh man, seriously. Shit.

258
00:20:08,770 --> 00:20:10,105
Yes, hello?

259
00:20:10,981 --> 00:20:11,982
Yes.

260
00:20:12,941 --> 00:20:13,859
What?

261
00:20:16,278 --> 00:20:17,195
I see.

262
00:20:17,279 --> 00:20:18,655
Understood.

263
00:20:21,783 --> 00:20:23,201
481-3 HWASAN-RI, GANGSANG-MYEON

264
00:20:23,285 --> 00:20:24,619
They found the girl.

265
00:20:24,703 --> 00:20:26,204
Thank God. Damn.

266
00:20:26,288 --> 00:20:28,498
Kill the siren. Take it slow.

267
00:20:38,342 --> 00:20:39,968
Goddamn it.

268
00:20:40,469 --> 00:20:41,303
They're coming.

269
00:20:42,721 --> 00:20:45,349
Man, this place screams psycho.

270
00:20:45,432 --> 00:20:48,060
-Don't go in there.
-Yes, I'll lock it down.

271
00:20:49,311 --> 00:20:51,605
-This is a crime scene.
-Sure.

272
