-I swear to God! Just wait.

349
00:25:01,187 --> 00:25:03,148
Back off.
I'm about to have a panic attack.

350
00:25:03,231 --> 00:25:04,649
Panic attack? Whatever.

351
00:25:04,733 --> 00:25:06,818
Cops are quick, you bastard!

352
00:25:07,402 --> 00:25:08,486
You're so fucking slow.

353
00:25:17,078 --> 00:25:18,580
Hey, Chang-u. Go.

354
00:25:19,539 --> 00:25:20,665
See you later.

355
