-Hey!

363
00:25:59,663 --> 00:26:00,497
Hey! Stop them!

364
00:26:00,580 --> 00:26:01,998
-Hurry!
-Hey, stop!

365
00:26:03,500 --> 00:26:05,001
-Run! Damn it.
-Hey, you!

366
00:26:05,835 --> 00:26:06,711
Get out!

367
00:26:08,922 --> 00:26:10,006
-Hey!
-Damn it.

368
00:26:10,090 --> 00:26:11,216
They're going that way!

369
00:26:11,299 --> 00:26:12,759
