-Over there!
-Let's go!

375
00:26:31,152 --> 00:26:32,612
-Stop right there!
-Hey!

376
00:26:32,696 --> 00:26:34,197
-Hey!
-You fucking bastard!

377
00:26:34,280 --> 00:26:35,657
You fucking bastard!

378
00:26:35,740 --> 00:26:37,200
-Go that way!
-Hey!

379
00:26:37,283 --> 00:26:38,952
-Fucking hell!
-Hey!

380
00:26:39,869 --> 00:26:41,705
Stop! Hey, you!

381
00:26:46,876 --> 00:26:48,211
Hey! Stop, you bastard!

382
00:26:48,294 --> 00:26:49,421
Hey, you bastard!

383
00:26:49,504 --> 00:26:50,588
Stop right there!

384
00:26:51,464 --> 00:26:53,299
-Hey!
-Sir!

385
00:26:54,217 --> 00:26:55,051
Stop! Damn it!

386
00:26:55,135 --> 00:26:56,678
You bastard! Hey!

387
00:26:57,262 --> 00:26:59,305
-Go around.
-He's going over the wall!

388
00:26:59,389 --> 00:27:01,224
