-Go around!

389
00:27:04,853 --> 00:27:06,396
Hey! You!

390
00:27:07,480 --> 00:27:08,481
Stop right there!

391
00:27:11,985 --> 00:27:13,236
Where the hell did he go?

392
00:27:13,319 --> 00:27:14,529
Where did he…

393
00:27:14,612 --> 00:27:15,655
-What the hell?
-Huh?

394
00:27:15,739 --> 00:27:16,781
Where did he go?

395
00:27:16,865 --> 00:27:17,907
He came from there.

396
00:27:17,991 --> 00:27:21,244
-He's fast.
-You go this way. You, that way.

397
00:27:21,327 --> 00:27:22,704
-Move, you bastard!
-Damn it!

398
