401
00:27:28,168 --> 00:27:29,169
-Yes, sir.
-Got it!

402
00:27:49,856 --> 00:27:51,691
Hey! Noja!

403
00:27:53,401 --> 00:27:54,235
Noja!

404
00:27:55,653 --> 00:27:56,654
Noja!

405
00:27:59,449 --> 00:28:00,283
Noja!

406
00:28:01,785 --> 00:28:02,619
Noja.

407
00:28:03,620 --> 00:28:04,788
Noja.

408
00:28:11,878 --> 00:28:13,004
Hey.

409
00:28:13,087 --> 00:28:15,215
You remember me, right?

410
00:28:18,968 --> 00:28:21,679
By the way, what do you do?

411
00:28:21,763 --> 00:28:23,181
Who the hell are you?

412
00:28:28,520 --> 00:28:29,896
Are you dead?

413
00:28:29,979 --> 00:28:31,523
Bastard, damn it.

414
00:29:23,783 --> 00:29:26,452
You can't even take a hit?

415
00:29:26,536 --> 00:29:27,912
Hey, what's your name?

416
00:29:27,996 --> 00:29:30,456
You said you didn't know Kim Yeong-geun,
you bastard.

417
00:29:30,540 --> 00:29:31,708
Where's Noja?

418
