Here.

419
00:29:36,421 --> 00:29:37,714
Fucking hell.

420
00:29:39,257 --> 00:29:42,552
You can't even take a hit?

421
00:29:47,223 --> 00:29:48,308
Hey.

422
00:29:48,808 --> 00:29:50,560
You can't even keep up?

423
