426
00:30:00,570 --> 00:30:02,113
Fucking hell.

427
00:30:06,326 --> 00:30:07,535
Damn it.

428
00:30:07,619 --> 00:30:08,828
-Huh? Sir.
-My legs.

429
00:30:08,912 --> 00:30:09,996
-I don't know.
-Here.

430
00:30:10,079 --> 00:30:10,914
Sir, wait.

431
00:30:11,539 --> 00:30:12,749
What the hell?

432
00:30:19,923 --> 00:30:21,215
Why are you sitting there?

433
00:30:22,175 --> 00:30:23,760
Because I can't even take a hit.

434
00:30:25,386 --> 00:30:26,638
You got beaten up?

435
00:30:27,472 --> 00:30:29,432
-You actually got beaten up for once.
-Fuck.

436
00:30:29,515 --> 00:30:31,309
Someone give me a light. Quick.

437
00:30:31,392 --> 00:30:34,604
Put that away. Get up.
We're going to that bastard's office.

438
00:30:35,104 --> 00:30:36,189
Come on. Let's go.

439
00:30:36,898 --> 00:30:40,234
Fuck, give me a light or the key!

440
00:30:40,318 --> 00:30:42,403
-Are you kidding me?
-Dumbass.

441
00:30:42,904 --> 00:30:45,907
Wow, you're just so fucking great.

442
00:30:45,990 --> 00:30:47,075
-Damn it.
-Min-ho.

443
00:30:47,158 --> 00:30:48,451
-Yes?
-Aw, my legs.

444
00:30:49,786 --> 00:30:51,496
-Hey, hurry up.
-Okay.

445
00:30:53,706 --> 00:30:54,540
Oh Lord.

446
00:31:05,051 --> 00:31:06,302
