456
00:33:08,424 --> 00:33:09,842
This is Dongbu Police Station.

457
00:33:11,469 --> 00:33:12,345
Okay.

458
00:33:15,014 --> 00:33:17,058
Okay. Got it.

459
00:33:18,267 --> 00:33:21,604
Sir. We just got a report of a body
in the Hangang River.

460
00:33:21,687 --> 00:33:23,773
-He's the abducted kid's father.
-What?

461
00:33:23,856 --> 00:33:25,108
Sir. Hurry. Get up.

462
00:33:25,191 --> 00:33:26,234
Yes, sir.

463
00:33:26,317 --> 00:33:27,568
Get ready to head out.

464
00:33:27,652 --> 00:33:28,528
Got it.

465
00:33:28,611 --> 00:33:30,363
What the fuck?

466
00:33:48,005 --> 00:33:48,840
Who?

467
00:33:48,923 --> 00:33:52,051
I'm Park Seung-gyu.
I used to work under Dong-seok.

468
00:33:55,304 --> 00:33:56,722
Come on.

469
00:33:56,806 --> 00:33:58,599
You really don't remember me.

470
00:33:59,851 --> 00:34:02,478
You seriously don't remember Dong-seok?

471
00:34:03,437 --> 00:34:07,483
You buried him on Mount Chilbo.

472
00:34:07,567 --> 00:34:08,568
I don't.

473
00:34:11,362 --> 00:34:12,822
You really don't remember me?

474
00:34:12,905 --> 00:34:16,242
I even hired you a few times recently
to find people.

475
00:34:16,325 --> 00:34:19,120
How about Myeong-su?
You probably know him.

476
00:34:19,203 --> 00:34:20,496
He worked under Dong-seok.

477
00:34:20,580 --> 00:34:22,832
