and fled to the Philippines.

478
00:34:22,915 --> 00:34:24,417
Don't know that punk either.

479
00:34:28,379 --> 00:34:30,965
Man, that kinda hurts.

480
00:34:31,048 --> 00:34:32,675
Just get to the point.

481
00:34:33,968 --> 00:34:35,720
Where are you coming from?

482
00:34:37,680 --> 00:34:38,514
Oh.

483
00:34:39,557 --> 00:34:42,810
My girlfriend was whining about the pain,
so I went to get painkillers.

484
00:34:42,894 --> 00:34:44,103
Your girlfriend?

485
