What, you suddenly into guys or something?

486
00:34:51,319 --> 00:34:53,404
I know everything. Damn it.

487
00:34:53,487 --> 00:34:55,865
Just tell me what you got yourself into.

488
00:34:55,948 --> 00:34:57,241
I'll help you.

489
00:34:57,325 --> 00:34:59,493
Hey, maybe you should take this.

490
00:35:00,620 --> 00:35:03,539
It works for headaches, toothaches,
and even menstrual cramps.

491
00:35:07,210 --> 00:35:09,045
-You fucking--
-Hey, stop.

492
00:35:09,545 --> 00:35:10,880
Fuck.

493
00:35:11,380 --> 00:35:13,758
Hey. You fucker.

494
00:35:14,467 --> 00:35:17,762
When I say get to the point,
you get to the point.

495
00:35:17,845 --> 00:35:19,305
Noja.

496
00:35:20,640 --> 00:35:22,558
At this rate, we're all gonna die.

497
00:35:23,351 --> 00:35:26,604
