500
00:35:37,156 --> 00:35:39,951
So I shook them for you.
I bet you didn't know that.

501
00:35:46,082 --> 00:35:48,918
Where's the money you took from Dong-seok?

502
00:35:49,001 --> 00:35:51,379
The money you took when you betrayed him.

503
00:35:51,462 --> 00:35:54,882
The money we busted our asses for.

504
00:35:57,760 --> 00:36:01,472
Some bastard sent a tip,
and now we're all tangled up in this.

505
00:36:01,555 --> 00:36:05,184
We're all about to be fucked
because of you.

506
00:36:05,810 --> 00:36:09,897
At this fucking rate, Noja,
you might end up at Mount Chilbo.

507
00:36:24,328 --> 00:36:27,999
