511
00:36:33,754 --> 00:36:35,131
What are you, a damn kid?

512
00:36:56,902 --> 00:36:57,862
Who is it?

513
00:37:17,173 --> 00:37:18,257
Who are you?

514
00:37:22,428 --> 00:37:23,262
Take

515
00:37:24,180 --> 00:37:25,181
this call.

516
00:37:28,059 --> 00:37:29,435
Not the big one.

517
00:37:31,270 --> 00:37:32,355
The skinny one.

518
00:37:44,283 --> 00:37:45,785
Speed dial one.

519
00:37:47,745 --> 00:37:49,372
Speed dial one.

520
00:38:07,098 --> 00:38:10,101
I let the cat out
so it could catch the rat.

521
00:38:10,184 --> 00:38:11,894
I guess you two are friends now, huh?

522
00:38:12,895 --> 00:38:13,813
Who are you?

523
