If you wanna know who I am,

528
00:38:25,658 --> 00:38:27,034
find yourself first.

529
00:38:27,535 --> 00:38:29,954
Find yourself first, you bastard.

530
00:38:30,955 --> 00:38:31,872
That rat bastard?

531
00:38:33,207 --> 00:38:36,001
Who is he calling a rat bastard?
You're the rat bastard.

532
00:38:36,085 --> 00:38:38,671
Police confirmed the body found
in the Hangang River…

533
00:38:38,754 --> 00:38:40,631
Wait, isn't that Soo-hyun?

534
00:38:40,714 --> 00:38:42,800
